  "sourceTitle": "Revolutionary War Balls",
  "sourceText": "Revolutionary War Balls\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, January 2, 2010 - 12:00am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup sugar\n2 eggs\n1 cup milk\n1 pinch salt\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n1 big dash nutmeg\n3 cups flour\n2 teaspoons baking powder\nPowdered sugar\nCinnamon sugar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix 8 ingredients. Drop by tablespoon in hot fat. While warm, roll in sugar or cinnamon mixture. Militiamen carried them during the Revolutionary War. 2 Milk poo\n\nAbout\n\n\nvery ballish",
